[{"id": 1, "duration_s": 3.62, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "এয়া আমাৰ পাড়া, আটাইতকৈ ডাঙৰ টাংকী।"}, {"id": 2, "duration_s": 4.31, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "এই টাংকীত... এটা ভূত থাকে! উউউ!"}, {"id": 3, "duration_s": 2.13, "emotion": "curious", "text": "ভূত নাথাকে। মই কওঁনে?"}, {"id": 4, "duration_s": 0.88, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "চুপ!"}, {"id": 5, "duration_s": 4.35, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "মোৰ ভঁৰাল... ইয়াত কোনেও নাপাব।"}, {"id": 6, "duration_s": 2.29, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "তোৰ ভূতটো... টৰ্চত ভয় খায়।"}, {"id": 7, "duration_s": 2.38, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "ভূত সঁচা! আজি ৰাতি চাবি!"}, {"id": 8, "duration_s": 1.85, "emotion": "calm", "text": "ল'ৰা-ছোৱালী! ভাত সাজু!"}, {"id": 9, "duration_s": 2.33, "emotion": "giggly", "text": "পিঠা আগতেই পালেগৈ!"}, {"id": 10, "duration_s": 3.48, "emotion": "scared_whisper", "text": "আৰু তাৰ পাছত... ঠিক নিশা বাৰ বজাত..."}, {"id": 11, "duration_s": 1.85, "emotion": "scared_whisper", "text": "ভূ... ভূ... ভূত!"}, {"id": 12, "duration_s": 2.02, "emotion": "panicked", "text": "টাংকীক... নজৰ লাগিল!"}, {"id": 13, "duration_s": 2.51, "emotion": "scared_whisper", "text": "মৃদুলা! উঠ! টাংকীত ভূত!"}, {"id": 14, "duration_s": 2.28, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "নেমু! জলকীয়া! নেমু!"}, {"id": 15, "duration_s": 3.04, "emotion": "excited", "text": "হয় আইতা? ভূত? <gasp> সঁচা?"}, {"id": 16, "duration_s": 1.48, "emotion": "excited", "text": "শুনিছা নে? টাংকীত ভূত!"}, {"id": 17, "duration_s": 2.79, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "দহ ছেকেণ্ডত... গোটেই পাড়াই জানি গ'ল।"}, {"id": 18, "duration_s": 1.59, "emotion": "excited", "text": "হেল' বন্ধুসকল! লাইভ চলিছে!"}, {"id": 19, "duration_s": 2.25, "emotion": "excited", "text": "ভূত লাইভ! দুলাখ দৰ্শক!"}, {"id": 20, "duration_s": 1.5, "emotion": "scared_whisper", "text": "ভূত ডাঙৰীয়া, এটা ছেল্ফি?"}, {"id": 21, "duration_s": 0.99, "emotion": "proud", "text": "বিজ্ঞানে কয়... ভূত ৱাই-ফাইৰ পৰা আহে!"}, {"id": 22, "duration_s": 4.04, "emotion": 