: 1.48, "emotion": "happy", "text": "পিয়াহো লাগিছিল।"}, {"id": 45, "duration_s": 2.09, "emotion": "happy", "text": "বলা, যাওঁ! পানী আনিবলৈ!"}, {"id": 46, "duration_s": 2.22, "emotion": "sad", "text": "আজিও নহ'ল, ৰাণী?"}, {"id": 47, "duration_s": 2.76, "emotion": "excited", "text": "শুনিছা নে? ভূতে ৰাতি মোৰ নাম ল'লে!"}, {"id": 48, "duration_s": 1.82, "emotion": "proud", "text": "হুঁহ! মোৰ নাম দুবাৰ ল'লে!"}, {"id": 49, "duration_s": 3.14, "emotion": "proud", "text": "বিজ্ঞানে কয়... ভূতে ঠাণ্ডা পানী ভাল পায়।"}, {"id": 50, "duration_s": 1.6, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "চুপ!"}, {"id": 51, "duration_s": 0.62, "emotion": "curious", "text": "মই কওঁনে? পাছত।"}, {"id": 52, "duration_s": 3.57, "emotion": "excited", "text": "ভাই-ভনীসকল! ভূতৰ ভয়? চিন্তা নকৰিবা!"}, {"id": 53, "duration_s": 2.21, "emotion": "proud", "text": "এই যে তান্ত্ৰিক কানু দেউতা!"}, {"id": 54, "duration_s": 5.42, "emotion": "serious", "text": "অলখ নিৰঞ্জন! ভূত... বহুত বড় আছে।"}, {"id": 55, "duration_s": 3.35, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "হে হে... এইটো বাবাৰ... উলটা যোগ!"}, {"id": 56, "duration_s": 1.15, "emotion": "curious", "text": "দাড়ি... উলটা।"}, {"id": 57, "duration_s": 0.68, "emotion": "serious", "text": "লিখি ল!"}, {"id": 58, "duration_s": 2.83, "emotion": "proud", "text": "ভূত-প্ৰুফ নিমু! খালি পাঁচশ!"}, {"id": 59, "duration_s": 3.37, "emotion": "shocked", "text": "পাঁচশ? মোৰ দোকানত দুটকীয়া!"}, {"id": 60, "duration_s": 0.94, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "দুটা দিয়া!"}, {"id": 61, "duration_s": 2.49, "emotion": "excited", "text": "দেউতা, নেমু-জলকীয়া কম্বো!"}, {"id": 62, "duration_s": 1.51, "emotion": "proud", "text": "আঠটা নেমু! পুৰাই!"}, {"id": 63, "duration_s": 4.34, "emotion": "proud", "text": "আঠ? হুঁহ! দহটা দিয়া! গোটেই পাড়াই চাব!"}, {"id": 64, "duration_s": 2.22, "emotion": "happy", "text": "দহ! আৰু এটা ফ্ৰী!"}, {"id": 65, "duration_s": 2.34, "emotion": "angry", "text": "হেল'? কানু দেউতা, বাৰটা পাম নে?"}, {"id": 66, "duration_s": 1.99, "emotion": "proud", "text": "এতিয়া মই কাকো নডৰোঁ!"}, {"id": 67, "duration_s": 0.78, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "টিকটিকীকো?"}, {"id": 68, "duration_s": 1.05, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "নেমু বৰ কামৰ!"}, {"id": 69, "duration_s": 1.36, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "পাঁচ হাজাৰৰ নেমু, দেউতা!"}, {"id": 70, "duration_s": 1.97, "emotion": "calm", "text": "শৰবত ভাল হ'ব।"}, {"id": 71, "duration_s": 3.03, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "সন্ধিয়ালৈকে পাড়াত মানুহ কম, নেমু বেছি।"}, {"id": 72, "duration_s": 3.25, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "আজি ৰাতি এটা জোৰদাৰ 'উউউ' লাগে।"}, {"id": 73, "duration_s": 6.26, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "বতাস চলিলাক... ডবল ধান্ধা!"}, {"id": 74, "duration_s": 2.65, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "ৰাতি... গোটেই পাড়া কোকাৰ চোতালত।"}, {"id": 75, "duration_s": 1.947, "emotion": "tired", "text": "তদন্ত... হ'ব... ঘৰ্ৰ্ৰ..."}, {"id": 76, "duration_s": 5.62, "emotion": "serious", "text": "বিজ্ঞানে কয়, ভূত ঠিক বাৰ বজাত আহে।"}, {"id": 77, "duration_s": 2.34, "emotion": "tired", "text": "এতিয়া সাড়ে এঘাৰ। শোৱা।"}, {"id": 78, "duration_s": 1.39, "emotion": "angry", "text": "শুনিছা নে? চুৰি!"}, {"id": 79, "duration_s": 2.45, "emotion": "guilty", "text": "এইবোৰ... মোৰ সাধুৰ কাৰণেই।"}, {"id": 80, "duration_s": 1.39, "emotion": "serious", "text": "চুপ! শুনা।"}, {"id": 81, "duration_s": 3.96, "emotion": "shouting", "text": "কোন? তদন্ত হ'ব!"}, {"id": 82, "duration_s": 1.03, "emotion": "excited", "text": "বাঃ! দহত দহ!"}, {"id": 83, "duration_s": 1.52, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "ভূত! ভূত! ভূত!"}, {"id": 84, "duration_s": 0.731, "emotion": "panicked", "text": "ভূত!"}, {"id": 85, "duration_s": 1.78, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "মই! হৰি!"}, {"id": 86, "duration_s": 1.28, "emotion": "panicked", "text": "ভূতে কথাও কয়!"}, {"id": 87, "duration_s": 1.86, "emotion": "determined", "text": "ভূত? মোৰ চেণ্ডেল চা!"}, {"id": 88, "duration_s": 4.19, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "আই... নিশান... এতিয়াও... বঢ়িয়া।"}, {"id": 89, "duration_s": 2.05, "emotion": "excited", "text": "লাইভ চলিছে! পাঁচ লাখ!"}, {"id": 90, "duration_s": 1.38, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "বলা, যাওঁ! সকলো অটোত!"}, {"id": 91, "duration_s": 1.21, "emotion": "determined", "text": "ইমানতে! মই চাওঁ।"}, {"id": 92, "duration_s": 3.13, "emotion": "calm", "text": "বোৱাৰী, গণি চোৱা। ল'ৰাবোৰ ক'ত?"}, {"id": 93, "duration_s": 1.77, "emotion": "determined", "text": "এটা বুদ্ধি আছে! ভূতক প্ৰশ্ন সুধো।"}, {"id": 94, "duration_s": 3.1, "emotion": "curious", "text": "মই কওঁনে? ভয় প্ৰশ্নৰ পৰা পলায়।"}, {"id": 95, "duration_s": 1.28, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "চুপ! আগতে মই।"}, {"id": 96, "duration_s": 2.92, "emotion": "proud", "text": "মই... জলপান পহৰাম।"}, {"id": 97, "duration_s": 1.77, "emotion": "sarcastic", "text": "ভূত পালোঁ। গোলগাল ভূত।"}, {"id": 98, "duration_s": 2.41, "emotion": "curious", "text": "চোৱা! বতাহ বলিলেহে শব্দ হয়!"}, {"id": 99, "duration_s": 2.34, "emotion": "laughing", "text": "ভূতে... মোৰ আঙুলিক ভয় কৰে!"}, {"id": 100, "duration_s": 3.82, "emotion": "proud", "text": "বতাহ, পাইপ, ফাট। ভূত নম্বৰ এক সমাধান।"}, {"id": 101, "duration_s": 2.05, "emotion": "curious", "text": "শব্দ তো পাইপ। আৰু চকু?"}, {"id": 102, "duration_s": 3.12, "emotion": "proud", "text": "টৰ্চৰ পোহৰ, মেকুৰীৰ চকুত জিলিকে।"}, {"id": 103, "duration_s": 2.05, "emotion": "happy", "text": "ভূত নহয়, মেকুৰী!"}, {"id": 104, "duration_s": 3.09, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "ভিতৰলৈ কোনো নাযায়। পিঠা, পুটলি দে!"}, {"id": 105, "duration_s": 1.84, "emotion": "sad", "text": "মোৰ সমুচা-বিস্কুট... বিদায়।"}, {"id": 106, "duration_s": 3.42, "emotion": "happy", "text": "আহ, সৰু ভূত!"}, {"id": 107, "duration_s": 1.62, "emotion": "tender", "text": "ই বিস্কুট খাবলৈ সোমাইছিল।"}, {"id": 108, "duration_s": 2.45, "emotion": "surprised", "text": "অ'! ভিতৰত এটা টিনো আছে!"}, {"id": 109, "duration_s": 2.73, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "ভোক লাগিছিল! আটাইতকৈ ঠাণ্ডা ঠাই!"}, {"id": 110, "duration_s": 2.14, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "চুপ! ...আচ্ছা, এটা দে।"}, {"id": 111, "duration_s": 3.87, "emotion": "shouting", "text": "ৰবা! ভূত বহুত বিপদ আছে!"}, {"id": 112, "duration_s": 1.87, "emotion": "proud", "text": "এইয়া আপোনাৰ ভূত!"}, {"id": 113, "duration_s": 3.67, "emotion": "excited", "text": "দহ লাখ! ভূত নহয়, মেকুৰী ভাইৰেল!"}, {"id": 114, "duration_s": 3.71, "emotion": "proud", "text": "আৰু এইয়া ভূতৰ গান। ভঙা পাইপ।"}, {"id": 115, "duration_s": 3.55, "emotion": "proud", "text": "বিজ্ঞানে কয়... মই আগতেই জানিছিলোঁ।"}, {"id": 116, "duration_s": 2.15, "emotion": "shocked", "text": "অ'! এইজন তো মেলাৰ বেলুনৱালা!"}, {"id": 117, "duration_s": 2.03, "emotion": "excited", "text": "শুনিছা নে? বাবা নকলী!"}, {"id": 118, "duration_s": 1.82, "emotion": "comic_panic", "text": "হে হে... বাবাৰ সময় শেষ!"}, {"id": 119, "duration_s": 1.79, "emotion": "angry", "text": "মোৰ নেমুৰ হাজাৰ টকা!"}, {"id": 120, "duration_s": 1.45, "emotion": "shouting", "text": "এটকাও কম নহয়!"}, {"id": 121, "duration_s": 2.08, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "ধনু! পইচা ঘূৰা!"}, {"id": 122, "duration_s": 2.44, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "চিন্তা নকৰিবা বৌ... সকলোকে ঘূৰাই!"}, {"id": 123, "duration_s": 2.34, "emotion": "determined", "text": "আৰু মোৰ দহটা নেমু?"}, {"id": 124, "duration_s": 1.47, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "চেণ্ডেল... কেতিয়াও নুফাঁকে।"}, {"id": 125, "duration_s": 2.69, "emotion": "sad", "text": "হাজাৰ টকাৰ... এখন চেণ্ডেল।"}, {"id": 126, "duration_s": 3.362, "emotion": "mischievous", "text": "টাংকী মৌন... এতিয়া ধনৰামে 'উউউ'!"}, {"id": 127, "duration_s": 3.96, "emotion": "happy", "text": "বলা! ভূতৰ ছুটী!"}, {"id": 128, "duration_s": 3.47, "emotion": "proud", "text": "ভূত-প্ৰুফ নেমু... এতিয়া পিয়াহ-প্ৰুফ!"}, {"id": 129, "duration_s": 3.29, "emotion": "proud", "text": "মোৰ গিলাছ ডাঙৰ। গোটেই পাড়াই চাব!"}, {"id": 130, "duration_s": 3.36, "emotion": "embarrassed", "text": "নজৰ নহয়... পিয়াহ লাগিছে।"}, {"id": 131, "duration_s": 2.83, "emotion": "guilty", "text": "শুনিছা নে? ...আগতে সুধি চাওঁ।"}, {"id": 132, "duration_s": 2.55, "emotion": "happy", "text": "ভোক নহয়... পিয়াহ লাগিছিল!"}, {"id": 133, "duration_s": 3.9, "emotion": "guilty", "text": "কোকা, সকলো মোৰ ভূতৰ সাধুৰ পৰা আৰম্ভ হ'ল।"}, {"id": 134, "duration_s": 4.58, "emotion": "serious", "text": "ভয়ৰ দৰৱ প্ৰশ্ন... <short pause> বাবা নহয়।"}, {"id": 135, "duration_s": 4.66, "emotion": "calm", "text": "আগতে সোধা, পৰখা, তাৰ পাছত মানা।"}, {"id": 136, "duration_s": 3.31, "emotion": "proud", "text": "আৰু ভয় বেচাসকলক... পইচা নাই!"}, {"id": 137, "duration_s": 1.47, "emotion": "stern_warning", "text": "শুনিলা? চুপ!"}, {"id": 138, "duration_s": 2.32, "emotion": "proud", "text": "কৈছিলোঁ নহয়? মই কাকো নডৰোঁ!"}]